## What's included

- Content strategy grounded in what the audience actually searches for
- Editorial calendar
- Monthly posts, drafted and edited
- Light analytics reporting so we know what works

## How it works

A monthly retainer. Plan the month's content in one call, then ship.

## Good fit for

Businesses with expertise to share and no time to write about it.
